# boot.scen -- the title, the name from the appkey, the table list, a join
# at ai2 (two bots), the lobby, ready, and our first turn.
wait 60
snap title
wait 300
snap tables
press down
wait 10
snap tables2
press fire
wait 300
snap lobby
press fire
wait 60
snap ready
until 7A 1 900
wait 60
snap turn
xram 20 16
